NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000872 "=head1 DONATIONS"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000873 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000874 "If you'd like to thank me for the work I've done on this module, please"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000875 "consider making a \"donation\" to me via PayPal. I spend a lot of free time"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000876 "creating free software, and would appreciate any support you'd care to offer."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000877 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000878 "Please note that B<I am not suggesting that you must do this> in order for me"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000879 "to continue working on this particular software. I will continue to do so,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000880 "inasmuch as I have in the past, for as long as it interests me."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000881 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000882 "Similarly, a donation made in this way will probably not make me work on this"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000883 "software much more, unless I get so many donations that I can consider working"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000884 "on free software full time (let's all have a chuckle at that together)."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000885 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000886 "To donate, log into PayPal and send money to autarch@urth.org, or use the"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000887 "button at L<https://houseabsolute.com/foss-donations/>."
